## The Process to File a Palm Springs Lemon Law Claim

- Take your defective vehicle to an authorized repair facility. The manufacturer’s representatives will direct you to one.

- Gather and organize reports of all repairs:

- Issues with the vehicle

- Date of repairs

- Time spent in the repair facility

- Invoices

- Receipts

